OL,3,GNEWSABBC Radio Ulster wins four gold
OL,4,AIMRO awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Radio Ulster has won four gold
OL,7,Fawards at the Irish Music Rights
OL,8,FOrganisation (IMRO) Awards 2026.
OL,10,FThe gold winners included The Stephen
OL,11,FNolan Show in the Interactive Speech
OL,12,Fcategory and Stephen McCauley in the
OL,13,FSpecialist Music Programme category.
OL,15,FEvening Extra also won gold in the News
OL,16,FProgramme (Full Service) category for
OL,17,Freporting of the Soldier F verdict and
OL,18,FBBC Radio Foyle's North West Today
OL,19,Fsecured gold in the News Programme
OL,20,F(Local/ Regional) category for
OL,21,Freporting of the murder of Amy Doherty.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
